<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Circus Circus cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Circus Circus cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Schroder Wertheim &amp; Co said it downgraded Circus Circus Enterprises Inc to outperform from outperform significantly.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not available.</p>
<p>-- Circus Circus was off 5/8 to 31-1/2.</p>
